{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200b&quot;Wonderful Richman&quot; is an online multiplayer board game with elements of strategy and leisure. Players take turns rolling dice to move, purchase properties, upgrade buildings, use magic cards, utilize Paco's enhancements, and leverage the three unique skills of their animals to earn money, accumulate assets, and ultimately defeat their opponents.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u767d\u8fb9\u5934\u56fe.png?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paco Card Deck System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can freely customize their Paco Card Decks outside the game. During the game, the Paco Card Deck grants players a random enhancement opportunity every three rounds, and the enhanced Paco is randomly selected from the player's deck build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u5e15\u53efGIF.gif?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each little animal has its own exclusive skill. There are three types of skills: active skills, income skills, and passive skills. Players can formulate their own playstyles by combining the skill characteristics of each little animal with Paco and magic cards.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u6280\u80fd.png?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building - level Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The building - level gameplay is a new mode designed for construction and upgrading in Wonderful Richman. Players can carry out construction and upgrading on a single plot up to six times. There are over 50 building floors for players to choose from, and they can match the floor effects according to the in - game situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u5efa\u7b51\u5c42__2_.gif?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every gamer springs into action at once, without the hassle of taking turns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Wonderful Richman&quot; adopts a method of dividing each round into action phases, creating game conditions that allow all eight participating players to act simultaneously within each round. Players can perform the same actions during each distinct phase, significantly reducing the total game duration and enabling them to enjoy an exhilarating match without worrying about the game being too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u9636\u6bb5_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranking Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200bCustom Mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2771380?t=1750612282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/b46257c8ebd34f3ccd9edc208b7bbfedece8f281/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750612282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/bbd7f8a2a9023c55f45b1966422a36cfd7649b90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750612282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/bbd7f8a2a9023c55f45b1966422a36cfd7649b90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750612282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u8bf7\u591a\u591a\u5173\u6ce8\u6211\u4eec.png?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players' QQ Group: 763014654</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, everyone! Come and try our game! If you've got any ideas or suggestions about our game, just tell us in the group. We're famous for listening to what you say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come on, let's make Wonderful Richman a lot more fun together!</p></p><br><h1>Update plan</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/1F97BDDABA16F4A6D2FC63605A0DED5C.png?t=1750612282\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200b&quot;Wonderful Richman&quot; is an online multiplayer board game with elements of strategy and leisure. Players take turns rolling dice to move, purchase properties, upgrade buildings, use magic cards, utilize Paco's enhancements, and leverage the three unique skills of their animals to earn money, accumulate assets, and ultimately defeat their opponents.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u767d\u8fb9\u5934\u56fe.png?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paco Card Deck System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can freely customize their Paco Card Decks outside the game. During the game, the Paco Card Deck grants players a random enhancement opportunity every three rounds, and the enhanced Paco is randomly selected from the player's deck build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u5e15\u53efGIF.gif?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each little animal has its own exclusive skill. There are three types of skills: active skills, income skills, and passive skills. Players can formulate their own playstyles by combining the skill characteristics of each little animal with Paco and magic cards.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u6280\u80fd.png?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building - level Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The building - level gameplay is a new mode designed for construction and upgrading in Wonderful Richman. Players can carry out construction and upgrading on a single plot up to six times. There are over 50 building floors for players to choose from, and they can match the floor effects according to the in - game situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u5efa\u7b51\u5c42__2_.gif?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every gamer springs into action at once, without the hassle of taking turns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Wonderful Richman&quot; adopts a method of dividing each round into action phases, creating game conditions that allow all eight participating players to act simultaneously within each round. Players can perform the same actions during each distinct phase, significantly reducing the total game duration and enabling them to enjoy an exhilarating match without worrying about the game being too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/\u9636\u6bb5_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1750612282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranking Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200bCustom Mode</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u6d77\u68e0\u679c\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/8d5e66afd718fbc631a34b42b8749d7829e17283/header.jpg?t=1750612282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143969,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143969/movie480.mp4?t=1747967403","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143969/movie_max.mp4?t=1747967403"},"name":"\u5947\u5999\u5927\u5bcc\u7fc1\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste